{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22435","headline":"苦热喜凉 · 白居易","name":"苦热喜凉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"经时苦炎暑，心体但烦倦。\n白日一何长，清秋不可见。\n岁功成者去，天数极则变。\n潜知寒燠间，迁次如乘传。\n火云忽朝敛，金风俄夕扇。\n枕簟遂清凉，筋骸稍轻健。\n因思望月侣，好卜迎秋宴。\n竟夜无客来，引杯还自劝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}